{"articleNo":"2708","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2708&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 예비대학 생활관(기숙사) 입사 및 호실 배정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.01.12","hit":"13175","attachments":[{"name":"2011 예비대학 생활관 배정표.xls","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2708&attachNo=2064"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2011학년도 예비대학 생활관(기숙사) 입사 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2011학년도 수시합격생을 위한 예비대학 생활관 입사자 명단을 붙임과 같이 안내하오니 참고하시기 바라며, 아래 일정에 맞추어 입사하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 입사일시 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 일시 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1차 : 16일(일) 14:00 ~ 17:00 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2차 : 17일(월) 08:00 ~ 08:30 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 3차 : 오리엔테이션 이후&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;☞ 위 시간 중 가능한 시간에 입사하면 됩니다.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 장소 : 나래관 경비실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">퇴실 : </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 21일(금) 오후 5시까지 퇴사(필히 열쇠반납:나래관 경비실)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 2. 식당이용 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 조식 ․ 석식 : 학생식당 이용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 중식 : 생활관 식당 이용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;3. 준비물</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 이불, 취침간편복, 베개, 개인 세면도구, 휴대용가방</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(고가 및 중요 물품, 고액의 현금 등은 가급적 자제)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 121.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -121.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">준수사항 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -42.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 생활관을 이용하는 학생은 생활관 이용수칙에 서명하고, 이를 준수하여야 하며, 학생의 부주의에 의하여 발생하는 안전사고에 대하여는 학생 개인이 책임져야함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">퇴실시에는 키를 나래관 경비실에 필히 반납</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">하시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 비상연락처</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 생활관 행정실 478-7270, 교무연구처 478-7031</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
